/* ========== Pastel ==========
   A standalone theme with no day/night variants. Lavender-pink paper background + rose accent: dreamy yet readable.
   The dreamy lavender/sky blue/baby pink are too light and only used for backgrounds/lines/tints; text and accents use plum/rose dark enough
   to meet WCAG AA. Contrast (against the main background): ink 10.5, ink-soft 5.3, ink-muted 3.2, accent 4.3. */
